# Big level (1024 x 640): starts clamped to the bottom-left corner. Hopping
# right (hold right + jump) clears the step, ramp and pit while the camera
# scrolls right; climbing into the tower scrolls it up. The exact hop path
# depends on tuning; if physics numbers change, re-check the numbers here.
level big
expect cam.x == 0
expect cam.y == 320
200 RJ
expect cam.x > 250
expect cam.y == 320
200 RJ
expect cam.x == 784
expect cam.y < 320
